    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but breathing is the hard part, Elara. it feels like every breath is just dragging more weight behind me. why am i supposed to keep going? there is no victory waiting at the end of this, just more of the same emptiness. i just want the noise to stop. i want everything to just be quiet.",
